  "bodyHash": "93355d158415a454",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>归档声明</h2>\n<p>自 v1.42.0 版本起，Xaero's World Map 已内置扩展缩放功能，因此不再需要本模组。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/HEAD/assets/images/xaerosworldmap_01.png\" alt=\"Xaero的世界地图设置\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>XaeroZoomout</h2>\n<p>将 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fNcUtCpym\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a> 的最小缩放比例从 0.0625x 降低至 0.0025x。</p>\n<h3>主要特性</h3>\n<p>无需任何设置或配置；直接缩放即可自动生效。</p>\n<p>作为参考，在完全缩小状态下，Xaero's World Map 的显示范围通常约为 3 万方块宽。启用本模组后，显示宽度将扩展至约 76 万方块。</p>\n<p>注意：渲染世界地图会占用较多 CPU 资源，因此在完全缩小状态时可能会遇到一些卡顿。</p>\n<h3>许可协议</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0</a></p>\n<h3>联系方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fterminalmc.dev%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/XaeroZoomout?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub 问题反馈\"></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
